globs: apps/api/**/*.ts,apps/agents/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# NestJS services

- These apps are ESM. Local imports use `.js` specifiers (`./health.service.js`).
- Add features as Nest modules. Import them from `AppModule`.
- Keep global `ValidationPipe` (`whitelist`, `forbidNonWhitelisted`, `transform`) and CORS from `CORS_ORIGIN`.
- `GET /health` returns `HealthResponse` from `@supplyeagle/types`.
- Use `import type` for `@supplyeagle/types`.
- Mirror bootstrap/health/tsconfig changes across both Nest apps unless the difference is service name or port.
